WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.083
Kokotela thupana moo o batlang mola wa hao o qala teng mme o emise leoto le le leng pela yona.

00:00:08.083 --> 00:00:17.833
Sutisa leoto le leng ho nyolosa kapa ho theosa letswapo ho fihlela kgwele e fanyeha hodima level mark.

00:00:17.833 --> 00:00:20.667
Kenya thupana sebakeng seo.

00:00:20.667 --> 00:00:31.208
Boloka leoto leo le sa sisinyehe, potolosa leoto la pele ho ya lehlakoreng le leng, fumana ho lekalekana hape mme o kenye thupana.

00:00:31.208 --> 00:00:43.458
Tswela pele ho tshela letswapo.

00:00:43.458 --> 00:00:52.125
Mola wa monahano o tshelang letswapo o kopanyang dintlha tse bophahamong bo le bong.
